198	    <header>
199	        <h1>Welcome</h1>
200	    </header>
201	
202	    <main id="main-content">
203	        <article>
204	            <h2>Modern Web Template</h2>
205	            <p>This is an improved HTML template built with best practices for performance, accessibility, and maintainability.</p>
206	        </article>
207	
208	        <article>
209	            <h2>Key Features</h2>
210	            <p>
211	                This template includes semantic HTML elements, responsive design, modern CSS with gradients,
212	                proper meta tags for SEO, and accessibility considerations to create a solid foundation for any web project.
213	            </p>
214	            <ul class="feature-list">
215	                <li>Semantic HTML5 structure</li>
216	                <li>WCAG 2.1 accessibility compliance</li>
217	                <li>Mobile-first responsive design</li>
218	                <li>Keyboard navigation support</li>
219	                <li>Open Graph meta tags</li>
220	            </ul>
221	        </article>
222	
223	        <article>
224	            <h2>Get Started</h2>
225	            <p>
226	                Use this template as a foundation for your next project. It's clean, well-structured, and ready to be
227	                customized to meet your specific needs.
228	            </p>
229	            <button class="cta-button" aria-label="Learn more about the modern web template">Learn More</button>
230	        </article>
231	    </main>
232	
233	    <footer>
